Z||000000||Shiner||07-03-2001||06:37 PM||||I am sure I am not the only one here that is a little upset at the crap that has been going around PFF.  This was always a really nice forum, and all members were generally polite and meant well.  But lately, things have been getting screwy because, I think, there are a TON of members.  So, the solution?  We need an aditional moderator.  Cliff can't be on all the time watching the forum, and he shouldn't have to be.  <P>  Everybody should speak up, and tell Cliff and the other forum members your thoughts on PFF peace keeping.  <P>  And if you ever get the urge to be an ass (I do, quite often), go to LS6.com.  You can $hit-talk there as much as you want.  Actually, their whole forum is based AROUND that fact.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P><P>------------------<BR>-Shiner-<BR>'84 Sport Coupe<BR>'87 GT<BR>'86 SE 2M6 (parts car)||||reg||5
